WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.180
<v Dana, security desk>Now place each lure: how often it arrives, and how often people click.

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.010
<v Dana, security desk>Prize draws are rare and easy to spot.

3
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:12.280
<v Dana, security desk>Delivery notices are common, but rarely fool us.

4
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.165
<v Dana, security desk>Payroll messages are rare but convincing.

5
00:00:16.165 --> 00:00:20.070
<v Dana, security desk>Password resets and invoices are common and convincing.
